<title>MALAYSIA: Konsortium gets extension of suspension.</title>
<headline>Konsortium gets extension of suspension.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shipping company Konsortium Perkapalan Bhd and its associate Diperdana Corporation Bhd have been granted an extension of the suspension of their shares, said the Kuala Lumpur Stock Exchange on Friday.</p>
<p>The companies' shares will remain suspended until August 4, 1997 &quot;to make an announcement on its proposed acquisition of 29.35 percent stake in Malaysia International Shipping Corporation Bhd from (state pension fund) Kumpulan Wang Amanah Pencen,&quot; said the exchange.</p>
<p>The shares of both companies were suspended on July 4.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-201 4813)</p>
